WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.946
New Horizon colony log. The year 2045.

2
00:00:05.283 --> 00:00:10.731
Humanity has lived off the Earth for twelve
years. In the New Horizon lunar colony,

3
00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:13.123
resources stretch thinner every day.

4
00:00:14.417 --> 00:00:16.547
Do you think we'll ever get to go there?

5
00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.104
How did we end up like this?

6
00:00:19.124 --> 00:00:24.488
It didn't happen overnight. Every generation
inherited a planet a little worse than the one

7
00:00:24.508 --> 00:00:28.235
before. And everyone thought there was still
time to change it.

8
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.596
That night, Doctor Nikol gathers the colony.

9
00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:39.541
My team has activated Project Genesis. It can
send a human being through time. But it needs

10
00:00:39.561 --> 00:00:41.782
an extraordinary amount of energy.

11
00:00:43.883 --> 00:00:45.181
And if it fails?

12
00:00:45.201 --> 00:00:52.485
Genesis can only send you back to 2026 if the
future improves. If not, there will be no other chance.

13
00:00:53.283 --> 00:01:00.662
My name is Killa and I'm nine years old. My
grandma says the river used to warn us. That

14
00:01:00.682 --> 00:01:08.398
night, nobody warned us. Later, on the radio,
they said the satellites had been watching for

15
00:01:08.418 --> 00:01:13.799
years. If they were watching, why didn't
anyone come to tell us?

16
00:01:14.717 --> 00:01:20.399
Data was never missing. It had been there
since 2001. What was missing was someone to

17
00:01:20.419 --> 00:01:25.651
read it in time, check it against a second
source, and go out and warn people.

18
00:01:26.283 --> 00:01:33.110
Here. It's a photo of the Earth when it was
still green. I want you to look at it when you

19
00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:36.858
get there. So you remember why it's worth
saving.

20
00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:44.166
Temporal destination: the year 2026. Mission:
prevent the environmental collapse.

21
00:01:44.186 --> 00:01:49.608
Remember: you don't have to save the planet
alone. You have to make people want to save it with you.

22
00:01:51.117 --> 00:01:55.428
The future is not written. But every decision
leaves a mark.
